{
  "id": "to-be-remembered-items",
  "term": "to-be-remembered items",
  "definition": "To-be-remembered items are the actual units or pieces of information a person must keep in short-term memory, as distinct from remembering the sequence in which they appeared. In verbal memory tasks, this refers to the words or other verbal material themselves rather than their presentation order.",
